.SH NAME
.PP
gemini-markets-candles - Get recent OHLCV candles


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBgemini-markets candles  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Fetch recent candlestick (OHLCV) data for a prediction market contract.

.PP
Simpler than klines - just specify symbol and timeframe to get recent candles.

.PP
Timeframes: 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1hr, 6hr, 1day

.PP
Examples:
  gemini-markets candles GEMI-OSCARBP26-OSBP26ONEB --timeframe 1day
  gemini-markets candles GEMI-BTC2602252200-HI65000 --timeframe 1hr --limit 24


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for candles

.PP
\fB--limit\fP=0
	max number of candles to return

.PP
\fB--timeframe\fP="1day"
	candle timeframe: 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1hr, 6hr, 1day


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--no-websocket\fP[=false]
	disable WebSocket and use REST API only

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="json"
	output format: json, table, or csv

.PP
